The {{Term/Store|Salvager Vest||Series, BotW}} is an [[Item]] in {{BotW}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Salvager Vest is a piece of [[Armor]] in {{BotW}}, part of the [[Salvager Armor Set]]. It is obtained from a [[Treasure Chest]] as part of the "[[Xenoblade Chronicles 2|[Xenoblade Chronicles 2]]]" [[Side Quest]]. The Chest crashes on the [[Akkala Wilds]] after [[Link]] looks to the eastern sky from the left eye of [[Skull Lake]] during the night. After obtaining the Salvager Vest, [[Granté]] will begin selling it for 50 [[Rupee]]s. When worn, the Salvager Vest provides one level of [[Swim Speed Up]]. The Salvager Vest cannot be [[Enhancing|Enhance]]d by a [[Great Fairy]], nor can it be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

